      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `moderate_text.py` that scores user text for unsafe or policy-violating content using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Comprehend service, which is a natural language processing (NLP) service that uses machine learning to find insights and relationships in text. The specific provider-identifying signal will be the import of the `boto3` library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, and the use of the `comprehend` client. </thinking>\n",
